      <rules>
        <rule name="Power Fields" hidden="false" id="a85f-126b-0d8a-c5cc">
          <description>In each Command Phase, roll 6d6. For each 4+, the Stompa generates a Void Shield (to a max of 5). For each duplicate roll, the Stoma suffers 1 MortalWound. For example, if the rolls are 2, 4, 4, 6, 6, 6, then the Stompa gains 5 Void Shields and loses 3 Mortal Wounds (for one of the 4’s and two of the 6’s)</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
